{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-09T13:49:19.876Z","author":"pm-github","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"ci","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## What happened (2026-11-09)\n\nCI run 42590449630 (Dependabot pm-toolchain PR #203, head 1996b06) had `test (22)` and `test (26)` sitting in **Full Bun release gate** from 09:36Z and 09:54Z until the orchestrator cancelled them at 11:55Z. That is more than two hours with no output. The last test line before the hang was `✔ diagnostic output is bounded and never echoes source text or machine paths (8262 ms)`, so something after it never exits under Bun: a child process, an open handle, or a test that waits forever.\n\nThe CI jobs set no `timeout-minutes`, so GitHub's 6-hour default applies. On a shared free-tier account, two hung jobs starve every other repository's CI. 77 runs were queued fleet-wide while this happened.\n\n## Fix\n\n1. Find the test or teardown that keeps the Bun gate alive after the last test. For example, run `bun run release:check` locally with a timer, or with `--test-timeout` and active-handle reporting. Fix the leak, and add a regression that fails when a handle stays open.\n2. Add `timeout-minutes` to every CI job (`test`, `release gate`), sized at about twice the slowest healthy run, so a hang fails fast instead of holding runners.\n3. This repository is the starter for new packages, so carry the timeout into the template.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- The Bun release gate exits within its normal duration on both Node lines.\n- Every job in `.github/workflows/ci.yml` has `timeout-minutes`."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-ts-starter-github-38a2e98e983e-204"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Bun release gate hangs after its last test and CI jobs have no timeout (two runners held for 2+ hours)"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"GH issue #204: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ts-starter/issues/204 · author @unbraind · created 2026-11-09T11:55:55Z · updated 2026-11-09T11:55:55Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["gh:unbraind/pm-ts-starter#204","github_author:unbraind"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-09T13:49:19.876Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-09T13:49:19.876Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"pm-github"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"c20a0352cb7ac7d260ffe30ba98a33a025b245a1dd0e66a9eb9bc9e83f283e49","item_hash_version":3,"message":"bulk-item-transaction github-import-b29c7c97cf48a483 1-create-pm-ts-starter-github-38a2e98e983e-204-06f6a5c5c700 apply","event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"89dbaca14fab25c1c2a4d77c1581b21e3c9d6fb0b3ec1a58e7dcde7410b7b424"}
